# environment — never commit real values.
# Deliberately broad. The earlier list (.env, .env.local, .env.*.local) missed
# .env.production, which is the exact filename .env.production.example invites
# someone to create. Ignore everything and re-include the templates by name.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example

